msgstr "Endpoint"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:893
msgid "Server Transport"
msgstr "Server Transport"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:894
msgid ""
"<strong>Bearer Auth</strong> — create a Bearer Auth credential and paste the "
"API key below."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Bearer Auth</strong> – lege eine Bearer-Auth-Zugangsdaten an und "
"füge unten den API-Schlüssel ein."

